      "text": "```\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                    WINE PRODUCTION FLOW                          |\n|                                                                  |\n|  VINEYARD            HARVEST            WINERY                   |\n|  --------            -------            ------                   |\n|  Vitis vinifera      Brix/pH/TA         Crush/Destem             |\n|  Terroir             decision           -> Press (white)         |\n|  Annual cycle        Hand vs            -> Macerate (red)        |\n|  Pruning/training    mechanical         -> Ferment               |\n|                      pick               -> MLF (optional)        |\n|                                         -> Aging                 |\n|                                         -> Bottle                |\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+"
