      "text": "WHITE: Grapes -> Press -> Juice -> Ferment (no skin contact)\n  RED:   Grapes -> Crush -> Ferment ON SKINS -> Press -> Age\n  ROSE:  Grapes -> Short skin contact (hours) -> Press -> Ferment\n  ORANGE: White grapes fermented on skins like red wine\n```"
